---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Help Us Test PHV Prep UK on Android — Be a Beta Tester"
  description="PHV Prep UK is coming to Android. We need 12 beta testers before we can launch on the Play Store. Join now — it's free."
>
  <main class="md:flex md:justify-center">
    <article class="prose prose-lg max-w-[750px]">
      <h1>Help Us Test PHV Prep UK on Android — Be a Beta Tester</h1>

      <p>
        PHV Prep UK is already live on iPhone, and Android is next. Before we
        can release on the Google Play Store, we need a small group of
        drivers to test the app and confirm everything works correctly on
        Android devices.
      </p>

      <p>
        We're looking for <strong>12 beta testers</strong>. That's it. Once
        we hit that number, we can unlock the Play Store release.
      </p>

      <h2>What you get</h2>

      <ul>
        <li>
          Free access to the full app during the test period — including all
          300+ questions and the AI Tutor
        </li>
        <li>
          A say in how the app develops before it reaches a wider audience
        </li>
        <li>Early access before the public launch</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>What we need from you</h2>

      <ul>
        <li>An Android phone (any model running Android 8 or above)</li>
        <li>A Google account</li>
        <li>
          Willingness to use the app for a short test period and flag
          anything that doesn't work as expected
        </li>
      </ul>

      <p>
        You do not need to write a formal report. If something looks wrong or
        behaves unexpectedly, a quick message is enough.
      </p>

      <h2>How to sign up</h2>

      <p>
        Email us at
        <a href="mailto:support@yongchivo.com">support@yongchivo.com</a> with
        the subject line <strong>Android Beta Tester</strong> and include the
        Gmail address linked to your Google account. We'll send you an invite
        link directly.
      </p>

      <p>Spots are limited to 12. Once they're filled, sign-ups close.</p>

      <hr />

      <p>
        PHV Prep UK is built specifically for the Wolverhampton Private Hire
        Vehicle exam. 300+ exam-style questions, timed mock tests, and an AI
        Tutor — one payment, lifetime access.
      </p>
    </article>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
